Calliope examples
-----------------
The national-scale and urban-scale example models and their data originate
from the Calliope project and its contributors, under Apache-2.0. Their
licenses, version references and provenance records accompany the examples.
See examples/README.md and examples/calliope-0.7.0-glpk/README.md.

Pfenninger, S. and Pickering, B. (2018). Calliope: a multi-scale energy systems
modelling framework. Journal of Open Source Software, 3(29), 825.
https://doi.org/10.21105/joss.00825

Ontology resources
------------------
The bundled OntoCal draft uses OEO, PROV-O and their documented dependencies.
Upstream ontology headers, attribution metadata, OEO's CC0 notice and reuse
records are retained under calliomapper/resources/dependencies. Consult those
records for the relevant contributions and terms. The project's local OEO and
PROV-O derivatives are identified separately and are not official upstream
releases. The transformation records accompany them; docs/dependencies.md
explains their use and limits.
